  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Using the determinant rule to find the torque</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>&#964;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Thus, the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>&#964;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>17</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>19</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p></blockquote>"
